*.dump

# Env files hold config; only .env.example belongs in the repo. NOTE: .env,
# .env.production and .env.staging are currently still tracked (they carry only
# the public anon key, and CI reads them) — move those secrets to CI secrets and
# `git rm --cached` the files to fully honour this rule.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
